 should lend itself to future extension or pruning to add or remove value pools."]},{"tag":"p","children":["The computation of the non-malleable transaction identifier hash must include all newly incorporated elements except those that attest to transaction validity."]},{"tag":"p","children":["The computation of the commitment to authorizing data for a transaction must include all newly incorporated elements that attest to transaction validity."]},{"tag":"h2","children":["Non-requirements"],"id":"non-requirements"},{"tag":"p","children":["More general forms of extensibility, such as definining a key/value format that allows for parsers that are unaware of some components, are not required."]},{"tag":"h2","children":["Specification"],"id":"specification"},{"tag":"p","children":["All fields in this specification are encoded as little-endian."]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Zcash transaction format for transaction version 5 is as follows:"]},{"tag":"h3","children":["Transaction Format"],"id":"transaction-format"},{"tag":"table","children":[{"tag":"thead","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":[{"tag":"th","children":[{"tag":"p","children":["Bytes"]}]},{"tag":"th","children":[{"tag":"p","children":["Name"]}]},{"tag":"th","children":[{"tag":"p","children":["Data Type"]}]},{"tag":"th","children":[{"tag":"p","children":["Description"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":[{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"strong","children":["Common Transaction Fields"]}]}],"colspan":4}]},{"tag":"tr","children":[{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"p","children":["4"]}]},{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"p","children":["header"]}]},{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"p","children":["uint32"]}]},{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"dl","children":[{"tag":"dt","children":["Contains:"]},{"tag":"dd","children":[{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"p","children":["fOverwintered"," flag (bit 31, always set)"]}]},{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"p","children"